<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cen bank o/n repo average yield 72.37 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech cen bank o/n repo average yield 72.37 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield in a Czech National Bank's (CNB) overnight repo tender held on Monday reached 72.37 percent, the CNB said.</p>
<p>It said that maximum yield determined by the bids was 75 percent, and that all bids at that level were accepted.</p>
